  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/574642/diamond-spheres-erudition-esoterica\">Diamond Spheres: Erudition &amp; Esoterica</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Occultism sphere, associated skill 5 ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As a special attack action, you can make a single weapon attack in conjunction with performing an Occultism sphere rite. If the target is struck by the attack, it is also subject to the rite. You can then choose whether to impose a -2 penalty to the saving throw against the rite against the attacked creature, or to gain a +2 competence bonus to any empowerment checks made with the rite.</p>\n<p>If using a scatter weapon, the rite only applies to a single target, chosen at the time of the attack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/operative-feats#toc35\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
